                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote13" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 13"><sup>13</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Alberto Alesina and Andrea Stella, &ldquo;<a href="http://ac.els-cdn.com/B9780444534545000062/1-s2.0-B9780444534545000062-main.pdf?_tid=e51c9cc6-71d7-11e6-9729-00000aab0f6b&amp;acdnat=1472908455_883ad608d8a1f70d5f09aef4cd177122">The Politics of Monetary Policy</a>,&rdquo; in Handbook of Monetary Economics, Vol. 3, edited by Benjamin M. Friedman and Michael Woodford, Netherlands: Elsevier, 2010, pp.1001-1054.</p></div>
